#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:6
msgid "# Installation"
msgstr "# 安装"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:9
msgid ""
"> Deploy FreeAnima on your machine — npm CLI, Docker Compose, or from "
"source.  > After install: [`security.md`](security.md) (credentials, bind "
"address) · [`database.md`](database.md) (PostgreSQL) · [`service.md`]"
"(service.md) (runtime commands)."
msgstr ""
"> 在你的机器上部署 FreeAnima — npm CLI、Docker Compose 或源码安装。 > 安装"
"后：[`security.md`](security.md)（凭证、绑定地址）· [`database.md`]"
"(database.md)（PostgreSQL）· [`service.md`](service.md)（运行时命令）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:11
msgid "## Choose a path"
msgstr "## 选择路径"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Path               | Best for                                   | PostgreSQL  | Redis                  | Credentials                                          |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ | ----------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **npm CLI**        | Day-to-day self-hosting on your OS         | You install | Optional (recommended) | [pass](https://www.passwordstore.org/) (recommended) |\n"
"| **Docker Compose** | Quick trial, minimal host setup            | Bundled     | Bundled                | `.env` env vars                                      |\n"
"| **Source**         | Contributors, bleeding-edge, custom builds | You install | Optional (recommended) | pass (recommended)                                   |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 路径               | 适用场景                                   | PostgreSQL  | Redis                  | 凭证                                                 |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------ | ----------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **npm CLI**        | 日常在自有 OS 上自托管                     | 自行安装    | 可选（推荐）           | [pass](https://www.passwordstore.org/)（推荐）       |\n"
"| **Docker Compose** | 快速试用、最少主机配置                     | 内置        | 内置                   | `.env` 环境变量                                      |\n"
"| **Source**         | 贡献者、前沿版本、自定义构建               | 自行安装    | 可选（推荐）           | pass（推荐）                                         |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:19
msgid ""
"All paths run the same `anima service` runtime (WebUI + tRPC + Gateway + "
"engine). PostgreSQL with **pgvector** is **required**. Redis powers fridge/"
"tasks cross-session context and **degrades silently** when unavailable — "
"Docker and production setups should still run it."
msgstr ""
"所有路径运行相同的 `anima service` 运行时（WebUI + tRPC + Gateway + "
"engine）。带 **pgvector** 的 PostgreSQL **必需**。Redis 支撑 fridge/tasks 跨 "
"session 上下文，不可用时**静默降级** — Docker 与生产环境仍应运行 Redis。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:21
msgid "## Shared prerequisites"
msgstr "## 共用前置条件"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Component      | Version / notes                                                                                                                                    |\n"
"| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Bun**        | >= 1.3.14 — required for npm CLI and source installs ([bun.sh](https://bun.sh))                                                                    |\n"
"| **PostgreSQL** | 17 recommended; extensions: `vector`, FTS helpers — see [`database.md`](database.md)                                                               |\n"
"| **Redis**      | 7.x recommended; defaults to `127.0.0.1:6379` when configured                                                                                      |\n"
"| **pass**       | Optional but recommended for npm/source — API keys and DB URLs stay out of config files ([`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 组件           | 版本 / 说明                                                                                                                                        |\n"
"| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **Bun**        | >= 1.3.14 — npm CLI 与源码安装必需（[bun.sh](https://bun.sh)）                                                                                     |\n"
"| **PostgreSQL** | 推荐 17；扩展：`vector`、FTS 辅助 — 见 [`database.md`](database.md)                                                                                |\n"
"| **Redis**      | 推荐 7.x；配置后默认 `127.0.0.1:6379`                                                                                                              |\n"
"| **pass**       | npm/源码可选但推荐 — API 密钥与 DB URL 不写入配置文件（[`security.md`](security.md#credential-responsibilities)）                                  |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:30
msgid ""
"Data directory: `~/.anima/` (override with `FREEANIMA_HOME`). Back it up "
"with your database."
msgstr ""
"数据目录：`~/.anima/`（可用 `FREEANIMA_HOME` 覆盖）。请与数据库一并备份。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:34
msgid "## npm CLI"
msgstr "## npm CLI"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:36
msgid ""
"The published package is [`@freeanima/cli`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/"
"@freeanima/cli) on npm. The binary is `anima`; runtime is Bun (not Node)."
msgstr ""
"npm 上的发布包为 [`@freeanima/cli`](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@freeanima/"
"cli)。二进制名为 `anima`；运行时为 Bun（非 Node）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:38
msgid "### 1. Install Bun and the CLI"
msgstr "### 1. 安装 Bun 与 CLI"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:42
msgid ""
"```bash # Install Bun (https://bun.sh/docs/installation)  curl -fsSL https://"
"bun.sh/install | bash"
msgstr ""
"```bash\n"
"# 安装 Bun（https://bun.sh/docs/installation）\n"
"curl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:45
msgid "# Global CLI from npm registry bun install -g @freeanima/cli"
msgstr ""
"# 从 npm 全局安装 CLI\n"
"bun install -g @freeanima/cli"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:49
msgid "# Verify anima --help ```"
msgstr ""
"# 验证\n"
"anima --help\n"
"```"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/install.md:51
msgid ""
"You can also use `npm install -g @freeanima/cli`, but `anima` still invokes "
"Bun — ensure `bun` is on your `PATH`."
msgstr ""
"也可使用 `npm install -g @freeanima/cli`，但 `anima` 仍调用 Bun — 请确保 "
"`bun` 在 `PATH` 中。"

#. type: Plain text
