#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/install.md:166
msgid ""
"Secrets live in `.env` — do not commit `.env` to git. For production, prefer "
"a secret manager or pass on the host and mount config instead of plaintext "
"keys in `.env`."
msgstr ""
"密钥存放在 `.env` — 勿将 `.env` 提交到 git。生产环境优先使用密钥管理器或主机 "
